# Simplified Chinese readme translation draft for AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs 0.1.6.
# Based on the official Stable Readme export.
# Human review and PTE/GTE approval are required before publication on WordPress.org.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs 0.1.6 readme\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-11-03 12:58+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: \n"
"Language-Team: Simplified Chinese\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"
"X-Generator: GlotPress/4.1.0\n"

#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid ""
"Connect WordPress AI to custom OpenAI-compatible APIs with Responses, Chat "
"Completions, a default model, and up to 10 models."
msgstr ""
"为 WordPress AI 接入自定义 OpenAI 兼容接口，支持 Responses、Chat Completions、默认模型及最多 10 "
"个模型。"

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs"
msgstr "AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Up to 10. New installations show one model row; click + Add model for more "
"rows. Existing model settings are retained. Model IDs must be unique."
msgstr "最多 10 个。新安装时仅显示一行模型配置；点击“添加模型”即可增加。已有模型设置会保留，且每个模型的 ID 必须唯一。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes. Select Default beside an enabled model on this plugin's settings screen"
" and save. The default is preferred by automatic text generation in the "
"WordPress AI plugin and listed first within this provider. Explicit model or"
" provider selections in individual features take precedence. Removing or "
"disabling the default selects the first remaining enabled model."
msgstr ""
"可以。在本插件的设置页面中，选中已启用模型旁的“默认”并保存。WordPress AI "
"插件的自动文本生成会优先使用该模型，它也会显示在本服务提供商的模型列表首位。各功能明确指定的模型或服务提供商仍优先生效。默认模型被删除或停用后，会选用剩余模型中第一个已启用的模型。"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "How many models can I configure?"
msgstr "可以配置多少个模型？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Can I choose a default model?"
msgstr "可以设置默认模型吗？"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid ""
"Use the + Add model button to add more models (up to 10), select an enabled "
"default model, and save."
msgstr "点击“+ 添加模型”按钮增加模型（最多 10 个），选择一个已启用的默认模型，然后保存。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"The API key is stored through the WordPress Connectors settings for this "
"provider."
msgstr "API 密钥通过该服务提供商在 WordPress Connectors 中的设置进行存储。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Install the plugin ZIP through the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr "通过 WordPress 的“插件”页面安装插件 ZIP 包。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes. Configure the base URL as a full HTTP URL such as "
"<code>http://localhost:1234/v1</code>."
msgstr "可以。请使用完整的 HTTP URL 配置基础地址，例如 <code>http://localhost:1234/v1</code>。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"It requires an API key for the OpenAI-compatible service configured by the "
"site administrator."
msgstr "需要你所配置的 OpenAI 兼容服务的 API 密钥。"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Can I use a local gateway?"
msgstr "可以使用本地网关吗？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Where is the API key stored?"
msgstr "API 密钥存储在哪里？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Does this plugin require an API key?"
msgstr "这个插件需要 API 密钥吗？"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Configure the API base URL and enabled model list."
msgstr "配置 API 基础 URL 和需要启用的模型。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Open <code>Settings &gt; AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs</code>."
msgstr "打开<code>设置 &gt; AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs</code>。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid ""
"Open <code>Settings &gt; Connectors</code> and set the API key for <code>AI "
"Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs</code>."
msgstr ""
"打开<code>设置 &gt; Connectors</code>，为 <code>AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible "
"APIs</code> 配置 API 密钥。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid ""
"Activate the plugin through the <code>Plugins</code> screen in WordPress."
msgstr "在 WordPress 的<code>插件</code>页面启用本插件。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"If another OpenAI-compatible gateway is configured, usage is subject to that"
" service provider's terms and privacy policy."
msgstr "如果配置的是其他 OpenAI 兼容网关，则使用时须遵守该服务提供商的服务条款与隐私政策。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"If the configured endpoint is OpenAI's API, usage is subject to OpenAI's "
"terms and privacy policy:"
msgstr "如果配置的地址是 OpenAI API，则使用时须遵守 OpenAI 的服务条款与隐私政策："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"Data sent to the configured service can include prompt text, system "
"instructions, model configuration, and any other request fields provided by "
"the WordPress AI Client for text generation."
msgstr "发送到所配置服务的数据可能包含提示词文本、系统指令、模型设置，以及 WordPress AI Client 为文本生成提供的其他请求字段。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"This plugin sends text generation requests to the API endpoint configured by"
" the site administrator. The plugin does not contact an AI service until an "
"administrator enters an API base URL and configures credentials."
msgstr "本插件会将文本生成请求发送至站点管理员配置的 API 接口。管理员填写 API 基础 URL 并配置凭据之前，插件不会连接 AI 服务。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"For Responses-compatible models, the plugin adapts WordPress AI Client chat-"
"style prompt payloads into the Responses API <code>input</code> format, then"
" adapts Responses API output back into the chat-style response shape "
"expected by the WordPress AI Client."
msgstr ""
"对于兼容 Responses 的模型，插件会将 WordPress AI Client 的聊天式提示词载荷转换为 Responses API 的 "
"<code>input</code> 格式，再将 Responses API 的输出转换为 WordPress AI Client "
"所需的聊天式响应结构。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Each model can use one of two endpoint types:"
msgstr "每个模型都可以选择以下两种接口之一："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"This plugin is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially"
" connected to OpenAI."
msgstr "本插件与 OpenAI 无隶属关系，也未获得 OpenAI 的认可、赞助或官方关联。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs registers an AI provider for the "
"WordPress AI Client. It lets site administrators configure a shared API base"
" URL, an API key through WordPress Connectors, and multiple text generation "
"models for a service that exposes OpenAI-compatible endpoints."
msgstr ""
"AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs 为 WordPress AI Client 注册一个 AI "
"服务提供商。站点管理员可为提供 OpenAI 兼容接口的服务配置共用的 API 基础 URL、通过 WordPress Connectors 管理的 "
"API 密钥，以及多个文本生成模型。"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Privacy policy: https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy"
msgstr "隐私政策：https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Terms: https://openai.com/policies/terms-of-use"
msgstr "服务条款：https://openai.com/policies/terms-of-use"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Chat Completions-compatible endpoint: <code>/v1/chat/completions</code>"
msgstr "兼容 Chat Completions 的接口：<code>/v1/chat/completions</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Responses-compatible endpoint: <code>/v1/responses</code>"
msgstr "兼容 Responses 的接口：<code>/v1/responses</code>"

#. Found in description header.
msgid "External Services"
msgstr "外部服务"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Provider settings screen for configuring the API base URL and models."
msgstr "用于配置 API 基础 URL 和模型的服务提供商设置页面。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Apply the environment base URL consistently and respect explicitly "
"configured request timeouts."
msgstr "统一使用环境变量中的基础 URL，并保留明确配置的请求超时时间。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Correct Responses assistant history and report interrupted streams, failed "
"requests, and output token limits."
msgstr "修正 Responses 助手历史消息格式，并报告流式中断、请求失败及输出令牌达到上限等情况。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Make model configuration changes available immediately without an API "
"discovery cache."
msgstr "模型设置更改立即生效，无需等待 API 模型发现缓存更新。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Allow up to 10 models with add and remove controls, starting with one row."
msgstr "支持最多 10 个模型，提供添加和删除按钮，初始仅显示一行。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add a default model for automatic text generation in the WordPress AI "
"plugin."
msgstr "为 WordPress AI 插件的自动文本生成添加默认模型设置。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Rename the plugin to AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs while preserving "
"existing settings and update compatibility."
msgstr "将插件更名为 AI Bridge for OpenAI-Compatible APIs，并保留现有设置及升级兼容性。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Aggregate streaming Responses API events into a standard text-generation "
"result."
msgstr "将 Responses API 流式事件汇总为标准文本生成结果。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add an optional per-model streaming setting for Responses API requests."
msgstr "为 Responses API 请求添加可选的逐模型流式响应设置。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Remove developer-only troubleshooting and local development details from the"
" FAQ."
msgstr "从常见问题中移除仅供开发者使用的排障和本地开发说明。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Clarify the public installation instructions."
msgstr "完善公开的安装说明。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Clarify that the plugin is licensed under GPLv2."
msgstr "明确插件采用 GPLv2 许可证。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Remove the unsupported <code>temperature</code> parameter from Responses API"
" requests."
msgstr "从 Responses API 请求中移除不受支持的 <code>temperature</code> 参数。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "首次发布。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add Chinese plugin descriptions, feature explanations, and setup "
"instructions."
msgstr "添加中文插件介绍、功能说明与配置步骤。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Keep repository documentation and the license file at the repository root."
msgstr "将仓库文档和许可证文件保留在仓库根目录。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Restore English source descriptions for the official WordPress.org "
"translation workflow."
msgstr "恢复英文源描述，以使用 WordPress.org 官方翻译流程。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add locale-based Simplified Chinese translations for plugin metadata and "
"settings."
msgstr "为插件元信息和设置界面添加按语言加载的简体中文翻译。"
